        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PCF100003SBRT, Pacific 1 Inch Diameter Acrylic Furniture Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Pacific Acrylic Cabinet Pull can be used on kitchen cabinets or in the bathroom but it is also well suited for use as a high-end furniture pull for dressers or armoire makeovers. The acrylic has a 1 inch diameter and is available as either clear or frosted. The mount is made out of solid brass and as such, is available in a huge selection of finish options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PCF07-specifications.gif?v=1704354731\" width=\"471\" height=\"206\" border=\"0\" alt=\"FII-PCF100003SBRT Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/pacific-acrylic-door-pull-first-impressions-pcf100sbr\"><b>1 Inch Diameter Acrylic Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Pacific Acrylic Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mount Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PCF07-specifications.pdf?v=1704262251\"><b>First Impressions PCF100003SBRT Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
