                "title": "Pacific Acrylic Cabinet Pull",
                "description": "The Pacific Acrylic Cabinet Pull can be used on kitchen cabinets or in the bathroom but it is also well suited for use as a high-end furniture pull for dressers or armoire makeovers. The acrylic has a 1 inch diameter and is available as either clear or frosted. The mount is made out of solid brass and as such, is available in a huge selection of finish options.",
